```
Test-side capture: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AuditLogCapture.java` (attaches a Logback `ListAppender` to the `AUDIT` logger; `anyContains`, `anyAtLevel`, `count`).

## 9. Owner segment — `OwnerSegment`
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerSegment.java`

Format `<TIER>_<AREA>`: TIER=`PREMIUM` if membershipLevel≥3 else `STANDARD`; AREA=`METRO` if locality ∈ {NSW,VIC,QLD} else `REGIONAL`. Set in `MembershipDecorator.addMembership` line 31 (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/MembershipDecorator.java`), using the already-computed DTO membershipLevel and locality.

