Test-side capture: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AuditLogCapture.java` (attaches a Logback `ListAppender` to the `AUDIT` logger; `anyContains`, `anyAtLevel`, `count`).

## 9. Owner segment — `OwnerSegment`
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerSegment.java`

Format `<TIER>_<AREA>`: TIER=`PREMIUM` if membershipLevel≥3 else `STANDARD`; AREA=`METRO` if locality ∈ {NSW,VIC,QLD} else `REGIONAL`. Set in `MembershipDecorator.addMembership` line 31 (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/MembershipDecorator.java`), using the already-computed DTO membershipLevel and locality.

## 10. DTOs/entities carrying these fields

- Entity `Owner` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`): stores `customerCode` only, column `customer_code` (lines 72-73, getter/setter 106-112). It does NOT store membershipNumber or checkDigit (those are derived). Also stores `namesakeCount`, `possibleDuplicate`, `possibleDuplicateOf`, `deleted`.
- `OwnerDto` is code-generated from OpenAPI `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml`. The derived identity fields are defined at:
  - `customerCode` lines 2126-2131 — description still says OLD format `'<LAST3>-<NNNN>'`, example `'FRA-0007'` (STALE vs code).
  - `membershipNumber` lines 2132-2137 (`'<customerCode>-M<YY>'`, example `'SMI-0007-M26'`).
  - `checkDigit` lines 2138-2146 (integer 0-9, Luhn over customerCode).
  - Related: `householdId` 2147-2152, `identityKey` 2153-2158 (spec says `normalizedTelephone|email` — STALE vs code which adds `|soundex(lastName)`), `locality` 2176-2181, `ownerSegment` 2182-2187, `timezone` 2228-2233, `fiscalYear` 2246-2251.
