- `OwnerMapper` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`) populates these DTO fields via MapStruct expressions: `membershipNumber` (line 27), `checkDigit` (line 28), `locality`/`timezone` derived from the customerCode prefix (lines 31-32), `fiscalYear` (line 35), `identityKey` (line 26), `householdId` (line 25). `customerCode` itself maps straight from the entity field (no explicit `@Mapping`). `membershipLevel`/`membershipPoints`/`ownerSegment` are filled by `MembershipDecorator`.

## 11. Tests referencing these fields

- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceTest.java` — the only assertion test. It expects the TARGET unified model: a `memberId` field = `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`, asserts it starts with `NSW`, contains `shaHex(telephone+lastName, 8)`, and that `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` are absent. This does not match current code (which still emits separate fields and no `memberId`), so this test encodes the intended refactor rather than the current behavior.
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceBase.java` — reference algorithms and pinned tables the tests rely on: `sha256hex` (282-294), `shaHex(s,n)` first-n UPPER hex (297-299), `luhn` (301-321), `CITY_REGION` (228-229), `REGION_TIMEZONE` (232-233), `REGION_POSTCODES` (236-237), `region`/`timezone`/`validPostcode`/`knownOwner` helpers (244-265), `toBusinessDay`/`HOLIDAYS` (240-274).
- `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AuditLogCapture.java` — audit-log capture utility (see item 8).

## Supporting/related files (not primary but referenced)
- `owners.POST.yml` pipeline: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml` — order is `build → assignCustomerCode → deduplicateCustomerCode → countNamesakes → detectPossibleDuplicate → save → record → respond`, all under `govern: [ transaction ]`, endpoint guarded by `hasRole('OWNER_ADMIN')`.
